      <h2>Serving Ahmedabad</h2>
      <p>Fan Air India Pvt. Ltd. manufactures dry and wet scrubbers that remove pollutants from exhaust gases. For customers in Ahmedabad, our Dry &amp; Wet Scrubbers are commonly used for chemical, pharmaceutical, process and kitchen exhaust treatment.</p>
      <p>Ahmedabad and the wider Gujarat industrial belt, including the GIDC estates around Vatva, Naroda, Changodar and Sanand, is home to textile mills, chemical and pharmaceutical plants, engineering units and a fast-growing automobile cluster. Many of these sites run continuous processes in a hot, dry climate, where reliable air movement matters for both worker comfort and process quality.</p>
      <p>Every unit is built at our factory in Neemrana, Rajasthan and selected to suit the required airflow, static pressure and site conditions of your project. Our team can help with sizing and technical data before you order, and we dispatch finished equipment to sites across Ahmedabad and the rest of India.</p>
      <p class="loc-seo__cta">To get a quotation for Dry &amp; Wet Scrubbers in Ahmedabad, share your airflow, pressure and application details through our <a href="../contact.php" title="Contact Fan Air India">contact page</a>, call <a href="tel:+919811347199" title="Call Fan Air India">+91-9811347199</a> or email <a href="mailto:saurabh.joshi@fanair.in" title="Email Fan Air India">saurabh.joshi@fanair.in</a>.</p>
